WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.512
Sally: Hi, I'm home!

2
00:00:04.513 --> 00:00:08.370
Mom: Hello. Sally,

3
00:00:08.371 --> 00:00:10.550
look! What do you like?

4
00:00:10.551 --> 00:00:12.509
Sally: I like cats.

5
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:16.071
I don't like spiders.

6
00:00:16.072 --> 00:00:22.142
I really like dogs! Mom:

7
00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:24.497
Surprise!

8
00:00:24.498 --> 00:00:30.517
Sally: A dog! Thank you!

